    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d79">

                <pb facs="0144" n="54" sameAs="frus:frus1918Russiav02/pg54"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 861.00/1136</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Minister in China</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                        >Reinsch</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to the Secretary of State</hi></head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Telegram]</seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Peking</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1918-02-23T16:00:00+08:00"><hi rendition="#italic">February 23,
                                1918, 4 p.m.</hi></date>
                        <lb/> [<hi rendition="#italic">Received February 23, 10.02
                        a.m.</hi>]</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>My telegram February 21, 3 p.m. I do not believe in the wisdom of relying on
                    Semenov for leadership in restoring order in Siberia. He is reactionary military
                    autocrat of the old type.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Reinsch</hi></signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
